# Testsystem for core-shell model compared to Mitchel and Finchham
# Hendrik Heenen, June 2014

# ------------------------ INITIALIZATION ----------------------------

units 		metal
dimension	3
boundary	p	p	p
atom_style	full

# ----------------------- ATOM DEFINITION ----------------------------

fix csinfo all property/atom i_CSID
read_data data.coreshell fix csinfo NULL CS-Info
